development,

250
00:09:55,667 --> 00:09:57,067
Local schools...
(Servo laughing)

251
00:09:57,067 --> 00:09:58,967
- [Mike] Chinese
funeral procession.

252
00:09:58,967 --> 00:10:00,633
- [Servo] What?

253
00:10:00,633 --> 00:10:02,733
He's from Planet Dreadloc.

254
00:10:02,733 --> 00:10:04,400
- [Crow] The
pontiff has arrived.

255
00:10:05,867 --> 00:10:07,367
- [Mike] I was afraid the
alien was gonna be goofy.

256
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,133
- [Servo] Oo, man, it's bright,

257
00:10:11,133 --> 00:10:13,000
