my Ray Bans, wow!

258
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:17,533
(monster screeching)
(Servo imitating noise)

259
00:10:17,533 --> 00:10:18,733
- [Crow] Ah, thank you,

260
00:10:18,733 --> 00:10:20,767
thank you very much,
thank you, haha!

261
00:10:22,333 --> 00:10:24,967
- [Mike] Ohayo, ohayo,
those I must, ohayo.

262
00:10:27,567 --> 00:10:29,067
