263
00:10:34,733 --> 00:10:37,267
- [Crow] Oh, I forgot my purse.

264
00:10:38,433 --> 00:10:40,533
- [Mike] Jeez, it's
aerodynamically perfect.

265
00:10:42,233 --> 00:10:43,767
- [Servo] Oh boy, my
back is killin' me.

266
00:10:43,767 --> 00:10:46,533
I came to this planet 'cause
I heard they have Doans pills.

267
00:10:48,233 --> 00:10:49,500
- [Crow] He's tryin'
to carry off a look

268
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:51,467
